an5.42:2.3 starts: It is for the good, welfare,
an5.42:3.3 starts: Fame does not forsake one steadfast in the Dhamma,
sn45.30:1.5 starts: But what now are those five cords of sensual pleasure?’”
sn47.2:3.3 starts: It is in such a way that a bhikkhu exercises clear comprehension.
an10.54:9.1 starts: (6) “When it was said: ‘Almsfood too, I say, is twofold:
an10.54:10.1 starts: (7) “When it was said: ‘Lodgings too, I say, are twofold:
